message: "If you use this project, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "WasteAI: Deep Learning-Based Waste Classification"
authors:
  - family-names: "Gottumukkala"
    given-names: "Atchyuteswar"
    affiliation: "Student project"
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/Atchyuteswar/WasteAI"
url: "https://wasteai-atchyuteswar.streamlit.app/"
abstract: >-
  WasteAI is an academic research prototype for six-class waste image
  classification. It compares a custom CNN, MobileNetV2, VGG16 and VGG19,
  and provides a Streamlit interface for image inference and model evaluation.
